	(text_box "CONVENTIONS\n- Power leaves each sheet through the +12V, +3V3 and GND power symbols; signals through global labels (arrow shape = direction).\n- Every sheet is laid out left to right in numbered blocks, with design and layout notes next to the circuit they describe.\n- Board: 4 layers - F.Cu signals + GND pour, In1 solid GND, In2 +3V3, B.Cu GND pour. Vias tented, never in pads."
